					<thingDef>ShipMechChunk</thingDef>
					<count>11</count>
					<allowRoofed>false</allowRoofed>
				</li>
				<!-- Game start dialog -->
				
				<li Class="ScenPart_GameStartDialog">
					<def>GameStartDialog</def>
					<text>We had two stone lanterns, a few headlamps, and a pack of ammo.
Not that any of this was necessary for survival in the dark, but when the pitch-black darkness, full of whispering creatures, closes in around you, you want to hold on to the light - and anything that helps you forget about it.
The lanterns crackled, the lamps flickered, and the shadows behind the walls moved. Not all of them were just shadows. </text>
					<textKey>GameStartDialog</textKey>
					<closeSound>GameStartSting</closeSound>
				</li>
